/*******************************************************
 * AlphaEarth / Satellite Embeddings + Supervised LC
 * SINGLE MODE  OR  BENCHMARK MODE (AOIs x Algorithms)
 *
 * WHAT'S NEW IN THIS VERSION
 *  - Benchmark mode: NO prints, NO map layers, exports Drive CSV only.
 *  - Single mode: restores the “original-style” prints:
 *      * classifier.explain()
 *      * training confusion matrix + accuracy
 *      * feature importance (when available)
 *      * validation confusion matrix + OA/UA/PA/Kappa/F1
 *      * charts (importance chart)
 *    AND still exports:
 *      * optional Drive CSV table for the selected model
 *      * optional image/model assets with short task names
 *
 * IMPORTANT DESIGN
 *  - Benchmark/table computation avoids Image.classify() to prevent
 *    "Computed value too large".
 *  - Single mode can still classify the image for visualization/export,
 *    but prints/metrics are computed from validation samples (safe).
 *******************************************************/


